requirement OPS-001
title: Controlled mission lifecycle
statement:
  The mission-control system shall manage each mission through its authorized lifecycle.
end requirement

requirement SYS-005
title: Vehicle-bound dispatch
statement:
  The mission-control system shall bind each dispatch to the active vehicle identity.
decomposes: OPS-001
end requirement

requirement SYS-008
title: Monotonic timing basis
statement:
  The mission-control system shall use monotonic time for elapsed-time comparisons.
end requirement

requirement SYS-009
title: Loss-of-link audit record
statement:
  The mission-control system shall record each loss-of-link event.
end requirement

requirement GCA-001
title: Vehicle-bound dispatch adapter
statement:
  The ground-control adapter shall include the active vehicle identity in each dispatch.
decomposes: SYS-005
end requirement

requirement MCS-001
title: Loss-of-link event recording
statement:
  The event recorder shall persist each loss-of-link event.
end requirement
